(* The names of Haskell 98 (the haskell98 roadmap's M12): modules, their
   exports and scopes over a recursive group by a fixpoint, the renamer
   that resolves every name of a module's tree to its entity, and fixity
   resolution, read after names. It is written on the Basis Library and
   syntax.build alone, and is used by the library's library.build. *)
files
  strmap_sig.sml
  strmap.sml
  modules_sig.sml
  modules.sml
  fixity_sig.sml
  fixity.sml
  rename_sig.sml
  rename.sml
end
